format is read by a consumer that will reject an answer without it — the agent would produce work
nothing accepts, and the seam fails after the model has already been paid for.

- Reproduce every field name EXACTLY, in the same shape the template states it.
- NEVER drop one because it looks redundant, and NEVER rename one to something clearer.
- NEVER add a field. A consumer reads by name and has no place to put an invention.

